  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which of the following options are correct for the reaction?</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Au</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CN</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>Zn</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Au</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Zn</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CN</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>A. Redox reaction</p><p>B. Displacement reaction</p><p>C. Decomposition reaction</p><p>D. Combination reaction</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
